{
	quest.11A312A059738B8A.quest_desc: [
		"The Andesite Template is the foundation of Create's progression in modpack It is the very first template you'll craft and serves as the starting point for every future technological tier."
		""
		"Like all other templates, it is used to unlock a new stage of progression. Once obtained, combine it with an Andesite Casing in a Smithing Table to create the upgrade component required for Andesite-tier machines."
		""
		"More importantly, the Andesite Template is the key to unlocking every template that follows. As you progress through the modpack, each new template will build upon the previous one, guiding you through Create's technology in a structured and rewarding way."
	]
	quest.17ADFE8FF7A9312A.quest_desc: [
		"The Copper Template represents the second stage of Create's progression in a modpack. After mastering the Andesite tier, it's time to advance into the Copper Age, where new machines, components, and crafting possibilities become available."
		""
		"Like every other template, the Copper Template follows the same progression system. Once crafted, it unlocks the Copper Tier, granting access to all Copper-based machines, components, and recipes."
		""
		"Each new template expands your technological capabilities, bringing you one step closer to the more advanced tiers that await later in your journey."
	]
	quest.24C1981F58FAD524.title: "Item Vault"
	quest.71CC981C8658A29A.quest_desc: [
		"Before crafting the Brass Template, you must first obtain the Copper Template, as each template must be unlocked in order."
		""
		"Like every other template in the modpack, the Brass Template follows the same progression system. Once crafted, it grants access to the Brass Tier, unlocking all Brass-based components, machines, and recipes."
		""
		"Each template represents a new stage of technological progression, so make sure you've completed the previous tier before moving on to the next."
	]
	quest.7B105BD2AD1E4B1C.quest_desc: [
		"Create is one of the core mods in SL Factory Otimized and will be an essential part of your progression. Throughout your journey, you'll notice a number of balance changes designed to better fit the modpack's progression and overall gameplay experience."
		""
		"Don't worry—these changes aren't meant to make the mod unnecessarily complicated. Instead, they encourage you to explore Create's mechanics while keeping every machine, resource, and milestone meaningful as you advance through the modpack."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Progression Changes"
		""
		"While Create retains its familiar gameplay, its progression has been rebalanced to better fit the experience of SL Factory Otimized."
		""
		"The biggest change is the introduction of Progression Templates. Each stage of Create now requires a specific template to unlock the next tier of machines and components. This prevents players from rushing through the mod and ensures that every milestone feels earned."
		""
		"As you complete quests and advance through the modpack, you'll gain access to new templates, allowing you to craft more advanced Create components and continue your technological journey."
		""
		"The mechanics of Create remain unchanged—the Templates simply guide your progression, making every advancement more meaningful and rewarding."
	]
	quest.7B105BD2AD1E4B1C.title: "Welcome"
}
